  "description": "WinForms Control Library to display Weather data. Supports 9 weather API providers: OpenWeatherMap (Free and One Call 3.0), Open-Meteo (free, no key), WeatherAPI.com, Visual Crossing, Tomorrow.io, Meteo-Concept, Meteoblue, XWeather. Compatible with .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET 8.0.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
